## 🏗️ 8. Create Models
📌 models/staging/stg_sales.sql
{{ config(materialized='view') }}

select
    order_id,
    customer_name,
    amount,
    order_date
from DEMO_DB.RAW.RAW_SALES;

📌 models/marts/fct_sales.sql
{{ config(materialized='table') }}

select
    customer_name,
    count(order_id) as total_orders,
    sum(amount) as total_revenue
from {{ ref('stg_sales') }}
group by 1
order by 3 desc;

## 🚀 9. Run DBT

Run everything:

dbt run


Expected output:

