## 🛠 12. Troubleshooting
❌ dbt is not recognized

Install:

pip install dbt-core dbt-snowflake

❌ Connection error during dbt debug

Check:

Account format: xy12345.us-east-1

Schema & warehouse exist in Snowflake

Role has permissions

❌ Cannot see tables in Snowflake

Check this schema:

DEMO_DB.DBT_DEV.STAGING
DEMO_DB.DBT_DEV.MARTS

